OL,3,GNEWSAThe Vivienne's mum wants to put
OL,4,Ason's ashes in statue
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of drag artist James Lee
OL,7,FWilliams, better known as The Vivienne,
OL,8,Fhas said she wants to put her son's
OL,9,Fashes inside a proposed statue in his
OL,10,Fhonour.
OL,12,FWilliams, the first winner of Ru Paul's
OL,13,FDrag Race UK, died in January 2025 at
OL,14,Fthe age of 32 after struggling with
OL,15,Faddiction.
OL,17,FEarlier this year, his family announced
OL,18,Fplans to commission a tribute at the
OL,19,Fentrance to Liverpool's Pride Quarter.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
